          "coreNotes": "\n            <div class=\"space-y-4 text-slate-200\">\n              <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-space-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-cyan-400\">👥 1. Population Concepts and Formulas</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                  • <strong>Population:</strong> The total number of people living in a given geographic place at a given specific time.<br>\n                  • <strong>Population Change Formula:</strong><br>\n                  <code class=\"text-amber-300\">Population Change = (Births - Deaths) + (Immigration - Emigration)</code><br>\n                  • <strong>Population Density:</strong> The average number of people per unit of land area, usually expressed as <strong>people per square kilometer (people/km²)</strong>.<br>\n                  <code class=\"text-emerald-300\">Density = Total Population ÷ Total Area (km²)</code>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-space-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-amber-400\">🌍 2. Uneven Distribution and Growth Pressures</h4>\n                <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300\">\n                  <p>• <strong>Factors of Uneven Distribution:</strong><br>\n                  - <em>Physical:</em> Climate (rainfall, temperature), water availability, relief/topography, soil fertility, mineral resources.<br>\n                  - <em>Human:</em> Employment opportunities, transportation infrastructure, industrial centers, historical settlements, government policies.</p>\n                  <p>• <strong>Opportunities of Growth:</strong> Expanded workforce, larger domestic consumer market, increased innovation and productivity.<br>\n                  • <strong>Pressures of Rapid Growth:</strong> Shortages of potable water, food insecurity, deforestation, housing shortages, overstretched healthcare and educational facilities, rising unemployment.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ",
