          "coreNotes": "\n            <div class=\"space-y-4 text-slate-200\">\n              <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-space-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-rose-400\">💥 1. Definition and Methods of Terrorism</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                  • <strong>Definition:</strong> <strong>Terrorism</strong> is the premeditated, unlawful use or threat of violence, intimidation, and destruction against innocent civilians or non-combatants designed to induce widespread fear, panic, and coercion in pursuit of political, religious, or ideological goals.<br>\n                  • <strong>Tactics:</strong> Suicide bombings, kidnappings, armed assaults, sabotage of critical transport or energy infrastructure, and cyber-attacks.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-space-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-cyan-400\">🛡️ 2. Impacts and Comprehensive Prevention</h4>\n                <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300\">\n                  <p>• <strong>Impacts:</strong> Tragic loss of civilian life, severe physical trauma, massive internal and cross-border refugee displacement, destruction of vital public property, collapse of tourism and foreign investment, and polarization of communities.<br>\n                  • <strong>Sustainable Prevention:</strong><br>\n                  - Professional intelligence and border security cooperating regionally (e.g. IGAD).<br>\n                  - Strict adherence to the <strong>rule of law</strong>, due process, and constitutional protection of human rights to prevent marginalization.<br>\n                  - Addressing root socio-economic drivers such as youth unemployment, extreme poverty, and political disenfranchisement.<br>\n                  - Fostering civic education, interfaith dialogue, and community resilience against radicalization.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ",
