          "coreNotes": "\n            <div class=\"space-y-4 text-slate-200\">\n              <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-space-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-rose-400\">⛓️ 1. Definition and Forms of Human Trafficking</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                  • <strong>Textbook Definition:</strong> <strong>Human trafficking</strong> is the recruitment, transportation, transfer, harboring, or receipt of persons through illicit means (such as the threat or use of force, deception, fraud, abduction, or abuse of power) for the purpose of <strong>exploitation</strong>.<br>\n                  • <strong>Forms of Exploitation:</strong> Forced labor in hazardous conditions, domestic servitude, debt bondage, forced marriage, and sexual exploitation.<br>\n                  • <strong>Key Distinction:</strong> Unlike voluntary migration where individuals choose to travel legally, trafficking involves deception, loss of freedom, coercion, and exploitation.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-space-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400\">🛡️ 2. Vulnerabilities and Prevention Measures</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\">\n                  <li><strong>Vulnerability Factors:</strong> Rural poverty, youth unemployment, lack of formal job opportunities, misinformation from illicit brokers, and irregular migration routes (across deserts or by unseaworthy boats).</li>\n                  <li><strong>Prevention Strategies:</strong><br>\n                  - Widespread public awareness campaigns warning communities against fraudulent promises by human smugglers.<br>\n                  - Establishing legal, regulated labor migration frameworks with bilateral agreements ensuring worker protection.<br>\n                  - Stringent criminal law enforcement and prosecution of transnational trafficking syndicates.<br>\n                  - Comprehensive victim protection, psychological support, and vocational reintegration.</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ",
